      propertyPath: task.ThoughtText.dialogue.Array.data[0].dialogue
      value: Dinner was... just okay.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 966868564021206957, guid: 1d237f6ce9410a847812f7e5ab034948, type: 3}
      propertyPath: task.ThoughtText.dialogue.Array.data[1].dialogue
      value: Aghhh-dammit!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 966868564021206957, guid: 1d237f6ce9410a847812f7e5ab034948, type: 3}
      propertyPath: task.ThoughtText.dialogue.Array.data[2].dialogue
      value: Was that Dad? He's been in the garage for a while.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 966868564021206957, guid: 1d237f6ce9410a847812f7e5ab034948, type: 3}
      propertyPath: task.ThoughtText.dialogue.Array.data[3].dialogue
      value: I should see if he needs anything - It'll put him in a better mood.
